      "writtenOn": "2021-10-21T05:50:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Does this need to be asynchronous? Given that all the operations here are fast (BPF map writes, HashMap writes), it seems better to make the IPCs be synchronous and not have a handler thread at all. You just need the IPCs to grab locks on mBpfBlockedPortsMap.",
